&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;日本証券業協会  大阪地区協会に店頭登録。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:6.8pt;min-height:6.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;1971年１月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;アメリカ、カリフォルニアに、現地法人SHOFU Dental Corp.を設立。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:6.8pt;min-height:6.8pt;"&gt;
